WEBVTT

00:11.534 --> 00:12.368
Yo!

00:12.452 --> 00:15.371
THE DAY OF THE SPORTS FESTIVAL 6:30 AM
THE DAY OF THE SPORTS FESTIVAL 6:30 AM

00:15.455 --> 00:16.289
Hey, good morning!

00:16.372 --> 00:17.373
- Hey, good morning!
- Hey, lil Tsukko.

00:17.457 --> 00:18.416
- What's wrong?
- Oh.

00:19.292 --> 00:20.126
Well...

00:20.209 --> 00:23.504
I got kinda caught up in the moment when
I joined the cheer squad.

00:23.588 --> 00:27.175
And ever since I've been nervous
that I'll mess up the choreography.

00:27.258 --> 00:30.511
And then I'm worried whether
someone like me from a cultural club

00:30.595 --> 00:33.806
would be accepted attempting to
cheer people on, even though I'm

00:33.890 --> 00:35.767
not an athlete.

00:36.309 --> 00:38.144
All of it just makes me so anxious.

00:38.811 --> 00:41.773
No, everyone's gonna love you, so
let's cheer our hearts out!

00:41.856 --> 00:42.899
I get it.

00:44.776 --> 00:47.528
Could you maybe help her with that?

00:48.821 --> 00:49.822
Help her with that?

00:50.698 --> 00:53.117
Well, Momoka's probably not a bad person.

00:53.659 --> 00:57.246
And it's not like I'm gonna try to
make anything happen with Amamiya.

00:57.330 --> 00:58.456
I mean...

00:59.040 --> 01:01.250
She seems like she's nice to everyone.

01:01.876 --> 01:04.337
So I guess her being nice to me
isn't that weird.

01:05.088 --> 01:09.342
She doesn't know how I feel and,
honestly, no one else needs to either.

01:10.343 --> 01:11.219
So it's not like-

01:21.062 --> 01:22.188
Don't overthink it...

01:22.814 --> 01:23.773
Don't overthink it.

01:25.108 --> 01:25.942
Act normal...

01:26.859 --> 01:27.693
Act normal...

02:53.362 --> 02:55.698
THE RAMPARTS OF ICE

03:00.119 --> 03:03.581
Perception

03:04.081 --> 03:06.542
THE DAY OF THE SPORTS FESTIVAL 7:00 AM
FINAL MORNING PRACTICE

03:06.626 --> 03:08.753
We're gonna go out there and kick their
butts!

03:08.836 --> 03:09.670
Yeah!

03:09.754 --> 03:10.755
8:00 AM GIRLS' HAIR SETTING

03:10.838 --> 03:12.924
We have a ton of blue accessories so
whoever wants to put them in their hair,

03:13.007 --> 03:14.091
just grab some, okay?

03:14.759 --> 03:15.593
Hey, Yota?

03:15.676 --> 03:21.057
THE SHORT-HAIRED CREW WITH NOTHING TO DO

03:21.140 --> 03:22.391
- How nuts?
- It won't look all weird?

03:22.475 --> 03:23.976
It'll be fine. Don't worry!

03:24.060 --> 03:25.144
Just trust me!

03:25.228 --> 03:26.520
8:20 AM

03:26.604 --> 03:27.438
Whoa!

03:28.189 --> 03:30.024
Everyone's hair is so impressive!

03:30.858 --> 03:33.236
- Wow!
- You look great too!

03:34.403 --> 03:35.780
Lemme do your hair for you!

03:38.699 --> 03:40.284
Koyun. This is quite a look.

03:40.785 --> 03:42.411
Apparently, it's "onion hair."

03:42.495 --> 03:43.371
Oh no, Yota stop it.

03:43.454 --> 03:45.122
What? This is an onion?

03:45.206 --> 03:46.165
If Amamiya sees it...

03:46.874 --> 03:48.751
Oh, Jeez. Too late.

03:49.543 --> 03:51.045
Uh, what's going on with Miki?

03:52.505 --> 03:53.339
Huh?

03:53.422 --> 03:54.257
SNAP

03:54.340 --> 03:55.174
- Uh!
- Uh! Oh.

03:56.384 --> 03:57.301
You look good.

03:58.261 --> 03:59.095
Huh?

04:00.263 --> 04:01.264
All three of you do.

04:07.186 --> 04:08.938
SPORTS FESTIVAL
MORNING SEGMENT

04:09.021 --> 04:10.147
Let's go!

04:10.648 --> 04:12.316
Yota! Minato!

04:13.109 --> 04:14.443
Gah! It's super high up!

04:14.944 --> 04:16.279
It's low-key scary!

04:22.451 --> 04:24.662
She looks adorable, like a
little hamster.

04:24.745 --> 04:26.330
Ah, so cute!

04:26.914 --> 04:30.418
OBSTACLE RACE

04:30.501 --> 04:32.336
- Glide.
- Get a move on!

04:32.420 --> 04:33.254
Go!

04:33.337 --> 04:34.171
Glide.

04:34.255 --> 04:35.089
Let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go,

04:35.172 --> 04:36.007
GIRLS' POLE PULL

04:36.090 --> 04:37.591
let's go!

04:37.675 --> 04:38.926
- Yeah!
- Oh, Miki.

04:40.803 --> 04:41.971
PLOP PLOP

04:44.640 --> 04:45.641
Humiliating.

04:46.142 --> 04:46.976
There, there.

04:47.601 --> 04:49.020
CLUB COMPETITION RELAY RACE

04:50.396 --> 04:52.606
Whoa! What's up with you, Minato? Dang.

04:54.066 --> 04:54.984
Let's get a photo.

05:00.573 --> 05:03.075
Man, the costume gets me even more
into it!

05:03.159 --> 05:04.201
Right?

05:05.161 --> 05:07.496
The pants Miki sewed for me work
perfectly.

05:07.997 --> 05:10.207
- Wow, my gosh, you all look so cool!
- Hm?

05:10.708 --> 05:11.584
Hey, Momoka.

05:12.084 --> 05:13.794
That's a really good look for you.

05:13.878 --> 05:15.171
And for you too!

05:15.671 --> 05:17.465
I never see you with your hair up.

05:17.548 --> 05:20.176
Cute right? A third-year did it for me.

05:21.510 --> 05:23.512
- So cute!
- You are too. It looks amazing!

05:23.596 --> 05:24.430
Huh?

05:24.513 --> 05:25.681
CHITTER-CHATTER

05:25.765 --> 05:28.559
- When did they get so close?
- It gives a different vibe.

05:28.642 --> 05:31.228
- You think so?
- Tsukiko, you look totally adorable!

05:31.312 --> 05:32.146
You think so?

05:32.229 --> 05:33.064
What? What?! No way.

05:33.147 --> 05:36.484
I'm humbled to be told that by
someone like you. I mean, you would

05:36.567 --> 05:37.651
know about cute, right?
know about cute, right?

05:37.735 --> 05:38.611
Oh. What do I do?

05:42.740 --> 05:44.325
- Huh?
- Hey, I'll come with you.

05:44.408 --> 05:47.703
- That's okay!
- This is bad. What do I do?

05:48.704 --> 05:51.624
Oh, no.
I just had a really dark feeling come up.

05:56.837 --> 05:57.671
Whoa!

05:58.631 --> 05:59.465
Koyun.

06:01.008 --> 06:03.260
We seem to run into each other a lot.

06:03.344 --> 06:05.304
Sorry. I'll pay better attention.

06:06.013 --> 06:06.847
Uh.

06:07.848 --> 06:08.682
Hey, Yota?

06:09.433 --> 06:10.810
Hayato's over there and-

06:11.435 --> 06:12.269
Huh?

06:17.066 --> 06:18.067
SNATCH! GASP!

06:19.777 --> 06:21.612
Uh, no. It's not...

06:21.695 --> 06:22.738
It's not what?

06:24.907 --> 06:25.741
What do I do?

06:27.868 --> 06:28.953
Uh. I...

06:30.079 --> 06:32.331
I gotta get back to Miki and the
others. Bye!

06:33.290 --> 06:35.042
PANTING

06:35.126 --> 06:37.336
What was that?
What in the world am I doing?

06:38.796 --> 06:39.630
Koyun?

06:41.382 --> 06:43.300
AFTERNOON CHEER BATTLE SEGMENT

06:55.521 --> 06:56.355
Hah!

06:58.232 --> 06:59.233
So cool!

07:00.609 --> 07:02.611
EACH TEAM FINISHED WITHOUT A HITCH

07:03.237 --> 07:06.574
PHOTO-TAKING TIME
(THE POINTS ARE BEING TALLIED)

07:08.659 --> 07:11.120
- Wow, thank you so much!
- Wow, thank you so much!

07:12.580 --> 07:13.664
Like from a boy band.

07:14.165 --> 07:18.002
I'm gonna blow this picture up, turn it
into a poster and hang it in my room!

07:18.085 --> 07:19.295
My life span just increased by a hundred
years!

07:19.378 --> 07:20.588
Ah, the energy of youth.

07:23.340 --> 07:24.175
A photo.

07:25.968 --> 07:28.345
- No, no.
- Hey there, Amamiya!

07:29.346 --> 07:31.098
Let's take a selfie together, okay?

07:32.016 --> 07:33.392
Uh. Sure.

07:33.893 --> 07:34.935
Just like that.

07:35.436 --> 07:38.397
I need to ask Koyun directly, like she
just did.

07:39.106 --> 07:41.650
But right now, I'm way too scared.

07:43.527 --> 07:45.029
I got separated from everyone.

07:45.529 --> 07:47.907
Did they already go back to the
changing room?

07:53.496 --> 07:54.330
Oh!

07:54.413 --> 07:55.372
- Madam Koyun!
- Huh!

07:56.373 --> 08:00.044
BOUNCE BOUNCE I'M BEING BECKONED...

08:00.127 --> 08:01.295
Quick, get in here.

08:01.378 --> 08:02.880
Let's take a group selfie.

08:03.380 --> 08:05.674
WALKING

08:05.758 --> 08:08.594
I feel like I'd be in the way.
Ugh. That'd be so awkward.

08:08.677 --> 08:11.764
Here. Could you please take a photo of us?

08:13.015 --> 08:13.849
Uh.

08:15.601 --> 08:16.435
Sure.

08:17.269 --> 08:18.103
Uhh...

08:19.939 --> 08:22.233
Hold on, what kind of face is that?

08:25.528 --> 08:26.654
Thank you so much!

08:27.154 --> 08:28.864
Now one of just us. Say cheese!

08:29.823 --> 08:32.076
That was awesome! See you later!

08:34.203 --> 08:36.997
I was definitely making a weird face
in that picture.

08:37.081 --> 08:39.542
Let's take a photo over there!
Yeah, let's go!

08:39.625 --> 08:41.210
But edit it before posting.

08:42.419 --> 08:43.504
- A photo...
- A photo...

08:44.964 --> 08:46.173
Let's take one together.

08:46.715 --> 08:47.841
If I was gonna say it...

08:49.343 --> 08:53.514
- Now would definitely be the moment, but...
- Now would definitely be the moment, but...

08:55.516 --> 08:57.977
IT'D BE OUT OF CHARACTER
IT'D BE OUT OF CHARACTER

08:58.060 --> 09:00.980
My brain keeps coming up with all
these negative thoughts.

09:01.063 --> 09:03.941
WILL MY FEELINGS BE EXPOSED?
WILL MY FEELINGS BE EXPOSED?

09:04.024 --> 09:04.858
Stare.

09:04.942 --> 09:05.776
- Ah!
- Ah!

09:05.859 --> 09:06.694
- Huh?
- Huh?

09:10.197 --> 09:11.991
All right. Moment immortalized.

09:12.074 --> 09:13.117
Come on.

09:13.200 --> 09:15.369
The soccer club's gathering.
Move it along!

09:15.452 --> 09:17.121
Wait, wait, wait a minute!

09:17.621 --> 09:18.914
No, take it properly.

09:18.998 --> 09:20.291
Make sure it looks good.

09:20.374 --> 09:21.333
You diva.

09:22.751 --> 09:23.794
Wanna strike a pose?

09:24.545 --> 09:26.380
Huh? Um, I...

09:27.965 --> 09:28.882
FLUSTER

09:28.966 --> 09:30.634
- Uh. Mm.
- Mm. Uh.

09:30.718 --> 09:32.052
Hm? Hey.

09:32.761 --> 09:33.596
I'm taking it.

09:36.181 --> 09:37.349
Yo, Minato!

09:37.933 --> 09:39.476
Kenta was just asking for you.

09:39.977 --> 09:41.020
Oh.

09:41.103 --> 09:42.021
Thanks! Coming!

09:47.151 --> 09:48.611
FWUMP

09:52.448 --> 09:56.035
So is the soccer club always that
casual with each other or is it-

09:56.118 --> 09:56.952
Hey, Koyun.

09:57.703 --> 10:00.623
Is there anything you wanted to tell me?

10:04.543 --> 10:05.544
GRIN

10:05.628 --> 10:07.630
- Hmm?
- What?

10:08.589 --> 10:10.633
- Fade...
- Hey.

10:10.716 --> 10:11.550
Stop it.

10:13.093 --> 10:15.304
I don't think I'm keeping anything
from you.

10:16.430 --> 10:17.264
Really?

10:17.765 --> 10:18.599
Huh...

10:19.516 --> 10:23.395
I'm just saying, you have a habit of
keeping things from me.

10:23.479 --> 10:25.022
WAIT, IT WAS YOUR BIRTHDAY?!
YOU SHOULD'VE TOLD US.

10:25.105 --> 10:27.149
Like not telling me it was your birthday.

10:27.232 --> 10:29.568
To be honest, it makes me feel a little
sad.

10:29.652 --> 10:31.528
GLANCE

10:33.113 --> 10:34.281
I wasn't hiding it.

10:35.366 --> 10:36.241
It's more like.

10:37.034 --> 10:37.868
I just-

10:39.078 --> 10:40.704
I only just realized it myself.

10:41.205 --> 10:42.164
Yeah.

10:42.665 --> 10:45.125
And it really might only be all
in my head.

10:46.001 --> 10:47.127
I'm so confused and...

10:47.211 --> 10:48.253
I don't know.

10:48.754 --> 10:49.588
Huh.

10:50.214 --> 10:51.048
So I...

10:51.131 --> 10:53.801
I didn't think it was worth sharing with
anyone else.

10:54.760 --> 10:55.678
Or not yet anyway.

10:57.137 --> 11:00.808
Well, you know, even if it's just a hazy
thing you're not quite sure what

11:00.891 --> 11:05.771
it is yet, wouldn't you feel better
if you at least got it off your chest?

11:07.231 --> 11:09.817
I know I definitely felt better
after sharing what I was feeling with

11:09.900 --> 11:11.902
- you.
- Hm.

11:15.072 --> 11:15.906
Yota.

11:17.032 --> 11:19.118
- Mm?
- Shuffle, shuffle, shuffle.

11:19.201 --> 11:20.619
- CLICK CLATTER
- Come, come.

11:20.703 --> 11:23.330
Hm? Scuffle, scuffle, scuffle, scuffle.

11:23.831 --> 11:26.208
LOOKS AROUND

11:30.671 --> 11:32.965
The thing is, I think I...

11:42.433 --> 11:43.267
Hmm.

11:43.851 --> 11:44.685
I see.

11:46.311 --> 11:48.981
Koyun, you have surprisingly bad taste.

11:50.274 --> 11:53.444
But still, he looks pretty happy
while saying that, doesn't he?

11:55.112 --> 11:55.946
I see.

11:57.614 --> 11:59.241
So we're feeling the same thing.

12:02.244 --> 12:03.245
To be honest...

12:04.079 --> 12:06.165
- Huh?
- He wasn't my cup of tea.

12:06.665 --> 12:09.460
In fact, I was even scared of him.

12:10.252 --> 12:11.920
That's how I used to feel, but...

12:13.046 --> 12:14.840
Well I... I don't know why.

12:15.841 --> 12:17.468
Things just changed over time.

12:18.927 --> 12:22.556
I know this sounds weird, but I can't
explain how or when it happened or

12:22.639 --> 12:23.849
what I feel.

12:26.059 --> 12:27.519
Hey, welcome to the club.

12:30.522 --> 12:31.356
Mm.

12:35.277 --> 12:37.404
I can help you get some alone time
with him?

12:37.488 --> 12:38.697
No! Don't you even dare!

12:39.198 --> 12:40.199
Oh.

12:40.282 --> 12:43.035
DOING IT

12:43.118 --> 12:44.411
Sorry about that.

12:44.912 --> 12:46.121
HAHA

12:47.039 --> 12:47.873
Just know...

12:48.707 --> 12:52.085
I don't wanna take things further or
change it from how we are now.

12:53.253 --> 12:55.130
All of us hanging out together.

12:55.631 --> 12:57.841
Me and him enjoying each other's
friendship.

12:58.342 --> 13:00.511
I feel like that's more than enough for
me.

13:01.512 --> 13:03.972
I'm really comfortable with exactly
where we are.

13:05.557 --> 13:06.767
I'd hate to screw it up.

13:09.937 --> 13:11.522
We're both in the same boat.

13:11.605 --> 13:12.648
Hmm.

13:12.731 --> 13:15.943
Oh no, I wonder if someday my
heart will be filled with soot too

13:16.026 --> 13:18.111
- or something.
- We'll be twins.

13:19.112 --> 13:20.113
No thanks.

13:21.740 --> 13:24.409
Alright everyone, the points have all
been tallied up!

13:24.493 --> 13:26.370
The closing ceremony will now begin.

13:26.870 --> 13:28.705
Please make your way to the schoolyard.

13:28.789 --> 13:30.958
I hate to say it, but if it's
Minato we're talking about,

13:31.041 --> 13:32.793
it'll be hard.

13:33.502 --> 13:36.213
Yeah.
I kind of figured that would be the case.

13:37.464 --> 13:38.298
Hey!

13:38.382 --> 13:39.216
FOUND YOU!

13:39.299 --> 13:40.884
- Koyun! Yota. I found you!
- Hm?

13:42.886 --> 13:44.638
- Huh?
- Oh.

13:44.721 --> 13:47.057
I'm so glad I finally found you guys!

13:47.140 --> 13:49.685
The four of us haven't taken a photo
together yet.

13:49.768 --> 13:50.936
What do I do?

13:51.019 --> 13:54.982
Maybe it's 'cause I just opened up, but I
feel super self-conscious right now.

13:55.816 --> 13:56.650
Hm?

13:56.733 --> 13:59.486
Were Yota and Koyun alone together
this whole time?

14:00.153 --> 14:02.781
Were the two of them alone together
this whole time?

14:03.490 --> 14:04.700
GLANCE, GLANCE

14:06.118 --> 14:07.035
Don't look my way.

14:07.953 --> 14:08.787
Same to you.

14:11.832 --> 14:13.250
HAHA HEE-HEE-HEE...

14:13.333 --> 14:14.293
- Uh.
- Uh.

14:15.002 --> 14:17.462
The way we are right now is how I
want it to stay.

14:17.546 --> 14:18.380
GAPING

14:22.384 --> 14:23.510
I don't wanna ruin it.

14:24.887 --> 14:25.846
This thing we have.

14:28.724 --> 14:29.558
Selfie time!

14:30.559 --> 14:31.518
Everyone, scoot in!

14:32.394 --> 14:33.312
CLICK

14:33.812 --> 14:38.150
If I had one wish, I'd wish we could
keep this peace and happiness forever.

14:40.193 --> 14:42.029
GRADE 2 CLASS 2

14:42.112 --> 14:44.031
That was awesome, it was so great!

14:44.114 --> 14:47.409
Man, the sports festival was so much more
fun than last year's.

14:48.368 --> 14:49.328
It really was.

14:49.411 --> 14:52.122
NOISY

14:52.205 --> 14:55.876
I was honestly nervous about cheer
squad, but it ended up being super fun.

14:55.959 --> 14:56.793
Right?

14:56.877 --> 14:58.045
LAST YEAR'S SPORTS FESTIVAL...
A CLASS WITH ZERO UNITY

14:58.128 --> 15:01.798
Well, I guess how much fun you have
depends on who you do it with.

15:01.882 --> 15:04.927
I was thinking the same thing,
but decided not to say it.

15:05.010 --> 15:06.637
By the way, where's Miki?

15:07.304 --> 15:08.388
GRADE 2 CLASS 2 SPORTS COMMITTEE

15:08.472 --> 15:10.641
She has clean-up duties for sports
committee.

15:10.724 --> 15:11.642
HEEHEE...

15:11.725 --> 15:12.976
You got this, Yota.

15:13.060 --> 15:15.687
Alright!
Let's go karaoke our little butts off!

15:18.273 --> 15:20.817
- Man, I'm starving.
- I'm gonna order a boatload of fries.

15:20.901 --> 15:21.818
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

15:21.902 --> 15:23.695
- Yeah!
- Should we wait for Yota?

15:25.489 --> 15:26.865
- Okay.
- Boys have so much energy.

15:26.949 --> 15:28.116
They really do.

15:28.742 --> 15:29.576
Huh?

15:30.869 --> 15:31.703
Huh?

15:40.045 --> 15:41.129
- Oh!
- What's up?

15:41.213 --> 15:42.214
We made eye contact.

15:43.131 --> 15:44.216
You waiting for Miki?

15:44.925 --> 15:47.386
Mm-mm. We were about to head home.

15:47.886 --> 15:49.846
She told us not to wait up for her.

15:49.930 --> 15:50.931
Gotcha.

15:52.182 --> 15:53.350
Well, see you, Amamiya.

15:53.976 --> 15:54.810
Nice work today.

15:54.893 --> 15:56.478
- Uh!
- Let's head home, Tsukiko.

15:57.396 --> 15:59.231
Huh? No, really?

15:59.314 --> 16:00.565
She's gonna cut it short?

16:01.316 --> 16:04.111
I'm sure Amamiya must've wanted to
chat a bit longer.

16:04.194 --> 16:07.239
Then again, it's not like I'm gonna do
anything about it.

16:08.699 --> 16:09.533
Oh.

16:10.617 --> 16:12.077
The photos I took today.

16:12.160 --> 16:13.370
I'll text 'em to you.

16:14.371 --> 16:16.081
She's contacting me later!

16:16.581 --> 16:18.375
Good for you, Amamiya!

16:19.126 --> 16:20.460
Hey. Hold on!

16:20.961 --> 16:22.587
Th- The after-party on Saturday.

16:23.088 --> 16:24.423
Are you gonna be there?

16:25.298 --> 16:26.133
- Huh?
- Hm?

16:26.800 --> 16:27.634
After-party?

16:28.468 --> 16:30.095
The cheer squad after-party?

16:30.178 --> 16:31.555
We're getting yakiniku!

16:31.638 --> 16:32.514
- Huh?
- Huh?

16:32.597 --> 16:34.224
- Hadn't heard of it.
- Hadn't heard of it.

16:34.307 --> 16:35.892
They just sent a message to the blue
squad group chat.

16:35.976 --> 16:38.061
They're trying to get a headcount for it.

16:38.687 --> 16:39.980
Oh. Guess you're right.

16:40.480 --> 16:42.315
I had my notifications turned off.

16:42.941 --> 16:43.775
Me too.

16:43.859 --> 16:46.153
But why would you turn your notifications
off?

16:46.236 --> 16:49.489
- Cause there's too many of 'em.
- Cause there's too many of 'em.

16:50.991 --> 16:52.325
How goes it, Amamiya?

16:52.826 --> 16:54.077
What are you guys doing?

16:54.161 --> 16:55.120
Oh, Hayato.

16:55.203 --> 16:57.956
You're always hanging around as if you
actually belong in this class.

16:58.040 --> 16:59.666
What's up? What's this about?

16:59.750 --> 17:00.709
The party.

17:02.252 --> 17:04.337
- You goin'?
- Mmm.

17:04.880 --> 17:07.966
I work my part-time job Saturday, so
I'm not sure if I can.

17:08.050 --> 17:09.217
Oh, what time?

17:09.718 --> 17:11.511
From eleven a.m., 'til three p.m.

17:12.179 --> 17:14.097
Oh well, we're not meeting 'til six.

17:14.181 --> 17:15.432
You'll totally make it.

17:16.349 --> 17:17.642
You're not going, Hikawa?

17:18.226 --> 17:21.396
What? Why not?
It'll be more fun if we're all there!

17:21.480 --> 17:22.856
Bro, go back to your class.

17:23.482 --> 17:25.484
Come on, let's go!

17:27.486 --> 17:30.363
- That makes me so sad.
- It's not Class Two if we're not all

17:30.447 --> 17:31.406
- there, right?
- Uh?

17:31.948 --> 17:32.783
Huh?

17:32.866 --> 17:33.700
NOD

17:34.409 --> 17:35.243
I think...

17:35.327 --> 17:36.411
- We'll go.
- We'll go.

17:37.829 --> 17:38.705
- See ya.
- See ya.

17:38.789 --> 17:39.664
See you tomorrow.

17:45.045 --> 17:48.799
Other scare me.

17:48.882 --> 17:50.926
- It freaks me out.
- Oh no, I said that we'd go!

17:51.009 --> 17:52.010
You did say that.

17:52.094 --> 17:53.136
I can see it now.

17:53.220 --> 17:55.889
Me sitting in the corner of
the restaurant, unable to keep up

17:55.972 --> 17:57.641
with the vibe. What do I do?

17:58.141 --> 18:00.018
We'll just sit next to each other.

18:01.645 --> 18:02.479
Well...

18:03.313 --> 18:05.857
The sports festival came and went
quickly this year.

18:05.941 --> 18:07.025
It did.

18:07.109 --> 18:10.529
It's a bummer that we won't have cheer
squad practice any more, right?

18:10.612 --> 18:12.614
But I'm excited for the after-party.

18:12.697 --> 18:13.657
Right?

18:13.740 --> 18:14.991
SUPPLY ROOM

18:16.576 --> 18:19.663
You know I love a good after- party, but
I'm more looking forward to our next

18:19.746 --> 18:21.623
group hang. What should we do next time?

18:21.706 --> 18:22.999
The Uppi park again?

18:24.126 --> 18:27.462
They may offer different events depending
on the season we're in.

18:27.546 --> 18:28.922
The four seasons of Uppi.

18:30.340 --> 18:31.466
I kinda wanna see that.

18:31.550 --> 18:32.425
That's hilarious.

18:33.635 --> 18:34.469
Oh.

18:34.553 --> 18:37.055
Hey, just so you know, I haven't
forgotten about our plans for

18:37.139 --> 18:38.849
the two of us to hang one-on-one.

18:38.932 --> 18:40.809
So you better not forget either.

18:43.478 --> 18:44.354
Of course no-

18:44.437 --> 18:45.605
Let's go everywhere.

18:47.858 --> 18:48.692
Miki!

18:51.570 --> 18:52.696
Ugh! Ooh!

19:02.539 --> 19:03.915
Yeah. Ow.

19:03.999 --> 19:06.209
Yota? Are you alright?

19:07.377 --> 19:09.254
Whoa! Sorry! No, it's not-

19:09.337 --> 19:10.338
Er, i-it fell and I-

19:10.839 --> 19:11.798
Oh, uh, I know.

19:12.299 --> 19:13.592
And I appreciate it.

19:15.093 --> 19:16.636
Did you get hit on the forehead?

19:16.720 --> 19:17.679
Are you feeling okay?

19:17.762 --> 19:19.264
Uh. Uh! Hey!

19:20.265 --> 19:22.267
- Yeah, no, I'm fine!
- Huh?

19:22.350 --> 19:23.310
Uhh.

19:24.895 --> 19:26.605
Hey, what's the matter with you?

19:26.688 --> 19:27.689
Why're you being shy?

19:27.772 --> 19:29.274
We've known each other forever.

19:29.357 --> 19:32.027
Don't suddenly get all weird on me 'cause
I'm a girl.

19:33.528 --> 19:34.362
That's not it.

19:34.905 --> 19:36.573
It's not just that you're a girl.

19:39.075 --> 19:40.035
To me, you're Miki.

19:40.619 --> 19:41.953
You're not just some girl.

19:44.915 --> 19:45.749
Huh?

19:47.209 --> 19:48.126
What is he saying?

19:49.211 --> 19:50.795
Yeah, there's not doubt about it.

19:50.879 --> 19:52.797
You know no one else can be me but me!

20:00.180 --> 20:01.014
Hm?

20:11.650 --> 20:14.361
I'm just glad that the box wasn't full
of heavy stuff.

20:15.070 --> 20:15.904
For sure.

20:16.404 --> 20:17.739
How does it feel where it hit you?

20:17.822 --> 20:19.407
- Where was it again?
- I'm fine.

20:19.491 --> 20:20.325
Don't worry.

20:21.243 --> 20:23.328
I'm confused. What was that?

20:24.329 --> 20:25.163
It felt like-

20:30.502 --> 20:31.336
I'll help.

20:33.713 --> 20:34.547
Hm?

20:36.132 --> 20:36.967
No way.

20:37.634 --> 20:38.468
It can't be.

20:39.010 --> 20:40.220
No, that's not possible.

20:43.098 --> 20:45.141
I mean, it's me we're talking about.

20:45.850 --> 20:47.727
There's no way he'd see me like that.

20:57.862 --> 20:58.697
SWIFT

20:59.447 --> 21:00.782
Uh. Okay.

21:00.865 --> 21:01.700
There you go!

21:01.783 --> 21:02.617
- Huh?
- All done!

21:03.576 --> 21:04.536
We're outta here!

21:04.619 --> 21:05.453
Locking up!

21:05.954 --> 21:07.831
You know what? I gotta return the key.

21:07.914 --> 21:08.999
Okay, anyway, see ya!

21:09.082 --> 21:10.834
- Uh, Mi--
- That was fast.

21:12.210 --> 21:13.044
Miki.

21:17.716 --> 21:18.550
If...

21:19.301 --> 21:22.220
If Yota's feelings really are
what I think they are...

21:23.263 --> 21:25.181
How long has he felt this way?

21:35.066 --> 21:35.900
All this time...

21:35.984 --> 21:37.110
CLICK-CLICK-CLICK-CLICK-CLICK
SWIFT MOVEMENTS

21:37.193 --> 21:38.653
I thought we were friends.

21:41.448 --> 21:42.282
What do I do?

21:42.949 --> 21:46.411
If the entire time I've known you, I
thought our relationship was one

21:46.494 --> 21:50.874
thing, when actually it was something
very different.

21:52.751 --> 21:53.585
I love you.

21:55.420 --> 21:56.254
Mm.

21:56.921 --> 21:57.881
I love you, too.

22:00.342 --> 22:01.176
What do I do?

22:03.345 --> 22:04.596
All the memories we made...

22:05.889 --> 22:07.140
The things he said to me...

22:09.476 --> 22:10.352
All his kindness...

22:11.686 --> 22:13.563
Take on a different meaning now.
